{"id":419,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"未来創造教育で夢実現を支える流経柏","feature_description":"流通経済大学付属柏中学校・高等学校は、未来創造教育を軸に、中高一貫で学びと活動を伸ばす学校です。学習、部活動、探究のつながりがわかりやすく、学年を超えた交流の中で自分の役割を見つけやすい点が特徴です。スポーツも文化も幅広く、日々の挑戦を積み重ねやすい環境です。学校生活の導線が明確で、継続的に成長しやすいのも強みです。学習面と活動面を同時に前進させやすい校風です。","clubs":[{"id":8354,"name":"男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8355,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8356,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8357,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8358,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8359,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8360,"name":"駅伝部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8361,"name":"新体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8362,"name":"チアリーディング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8363,"name":"男子バスケット部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8364,"name":"女子バスケット部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.ryukei.ed.jp/junior/schoollife/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":8365,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.